# Environment Variables Template for Premium Features

# Existing variables (you should already have these)
# Mongo=your_mongodb_connection_string
# JWT_SECRET=your_jwt_secret

# Stripe Configuration (Required for Premium Features)
STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_test_your_stripe_secret_key_here
STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_test_your_stripe_publishable_key_here

# Optional: Stripe Webhook Secret (for production webhook verification)
STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_your_webhook_secret_here

# Notes:
# 1. Get your Stripe keys from: https://dashboard.stripe.com/test/apikeys
# 2. Use test keys (sk_test_... and pk_test_...) for development
# 3. Switch to live keys (sk_live_... and pk_live_...) for production
# 4. The STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY will also need to be added to your frontend environment
